WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.647
I had a free intro meeting, and I was

00:00:01.647 --> 00:00:03.918
like, let me do this, there's nothing negative that

00:00:03.918 --> 00:00:05.654
can happen if you talk to a person, you

00:00:05.654 --> 00:00:06.500
know, unauthorized.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.712
Sometimes it's also important to be able to recognize

00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:10.883
if there's something in someone's life that you need

00:00:10.883 --> 00:00:11.300
help with.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.025
I didn't really have any kind of structure, or

00:00:13.025 --> 00:00:14.863
value, or direction, and that's also why I wanted

00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:15.500
to talk to Niels.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.711
Both to have a comrade who could like, mirror

00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:19.922
you, but also just really tell, I'm feeling a

00:00:19.922 --> 00:00:21.887
little bad right now, what the hell am I

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:24.000
supposed to do to get out of this headache.
